    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russian roulette horror with 2-4 players, featuring a new card ability system for unique strategy and gameplay. Take a seat at the table.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Solo Or Co-Op With Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your luck at the table with classic Russian roulette gameplay featuring unique cards that introduce novel gameplay and strategy. Cards appear in the second round.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns firing a revolver pistol at the table</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique cards that can change the course of the battle, appearing at round 2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice chat for added laughs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Online Or Vs AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Healing card / Airshot card / Revolver spin card\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unpredictable Rounds:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round is unique, with a revolver chambered with a random assortment of live and dummy rounds. Strategy and luck are both your allies, as no two rounds will ever play out the same way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879340/extras/fd1c81fe37b3b44e3581d5941ea2c736.poster.avif?t=1744044520\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879340/extras/fd1c81fe37b3b44e3581d5941ea2c736.webm?t=1744044520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879340/extras/fd1c81fe37b3b44e3581d5941ea2c736.mp4?t=1744044520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take a seat at the Bunny Roulette Table</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your luck at the bunny table, you'll need it to win the game of classic Russian roulette with a twist!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tabletop Multiplayer Experience With Up To 4 Friends:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunny Roulette supports lobbies of up to four players, and you can also play solo with a play vs AI game mode.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russian roulette horror with 2-4 players, featuring a new card ability system for unique strategy and gameplay. Take a seat at the table.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Solo Or Co-Op With Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your luck at the table with classic Russian roulette gameplay featuring unique cards that introduce novel gameplay and strategy. Cards appear in the second round.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns firing a revolver pistol at the table</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique cards that can change the course of the battle, appearing at round 2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice chat for added laughs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Online Or Vs AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Healing card / Airshot card / Revolver spin card\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unpredictable Rounds:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round is unique, with a revolver chambered with a random assortment of live and dummy rounds. Strategy and luck are both your allies, as no two rounds will ever play out the same way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879340/extras/fd1c81fe37b3b44e3581d5941ea2c736.poster.avif?t=1744044520\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879340/extras/fd1c81fe37b3b44e3581d5941ea2c736.webm?t=1744044520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879340/extras/fd1c81fe37b3b44e3581d5941ea2c736.mp4?t=1744044520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take a seat at the Bunny Roulette Table</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your luck at the bunny table, you'll need it to win the game of classic Russian roulette with a twist!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tabletop Multiplayer Experience With Up To 4 Friends:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunny Roulette supports lobbies of up to four players, and you can also play solo with a play vs AI game mode.</p>",
